---
import ProjectLayout from '../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import ProjectNav from '../components/project/ProjectNav.astro';
import NextProject from '../components/project/NextProject.astro';
import '../styles/projects/forecasting.css';
---

<ProjectLayout title="ML Demand Forecasting · Sasha">
<div class="page" style="font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2E2326; background: #F6F1EA; min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 110px">
<div style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F3D9C8 0%, #F5E6DB 55%, #F6F1EA 100%); padding-bottom: 48px">
<ProjectNav />
<header class="wrap" style="text-align: center; padding-top: 88px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 26px; color: #7A4A2C">Data analytics &amp; machine learning</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1000px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(48px, 8.5vw, 112px); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.92; text-wrap: balance">Demand Forecasting.</h1>
<p style="margin: 28px auto 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F3436; text-wrap: balance">Predicting retail demand from historical sales with XGBoost, then using SHAP to explain how each business variable shapes the forecast.</p>
</header>
<div class="col" style="margin-top: 48px">
<div class="meta">
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7D5A44">Year</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">2025</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7D5A44">Team</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">Individual project</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7D5A44">Role</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">End-to-end ML workflow</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7D5A44">Code</p><a href="https://github.com/navisasabina/ml-demand-forecasting" style="font-weight: 600">GitHub ↗</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
<div class="stage" style="background: linear-gradient(140deg, #EDC3A8 0%, #F3D9C8 55%, #F5E6DB 100%)">
<div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">colab · demand_forecasting.ipynb</span></div>
<img src="assets/forecasting-shap.jpg" alt="SHAP feature importance plot" style="width: 100%; height: clamp(280px, 40vw, 560px); object-fit: contain; display: block; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px">
</div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 80px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">About the project</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px">A predictive analytics project that forecasts retail demand from historical sales. The XGBoost model estimates future demand and surfaces the key factors behind each prediction.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">To make the model transparent, SHAP (SHapley Additive exPlanations) interprets feature importance so results are easy to understand and explain.</p>

<h2 style="margin: 64px 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Project objectives</h2>
<p style="margin: 0">Build a reliable forecasting model that supports data-driven retail decisions and, beyond accuracy, show how each business variable contributes to the result through explainable ML.</p>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 56px">
<div class="trio">
<div class="panel" style="background: #F5E6DB"><div class="browser round tilt" style="width: 100%"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">actual_vs_pred.png</span></div><img src="assets/forecasting-actual-vs-pred.jpg" alt="Actual vs predicted revenue over time" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 10px"></div></div>
<div class="panel" style="background: #F3D9C8"><div class="browser round tilt2" style="width: 100%"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">learning_curve.png</span></div><img src="assets/forecasting-learning-curve.jpg" alt="XGBoost learning curve" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 10px"></div></div>
<div class="panel" style="background: #F5E6DB"><div class="browser round tilt" style="width: 100%"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">residuals.png</span></div><img src="assets/forecasting-residuals.jpg" alt="Residual plot for the XGBoost model" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 10px"></div></div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 72px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Development process</h2>
<ol class="steps" style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0">
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F0E2D8; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #7A4A2C">01</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45">Data preparation</span></li>
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F0E2D8; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #7A4A2C">02</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45">Feature engineering</span></li>
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F0E2D8; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #7A4A2C">03</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45">XGBoost training</span></li>
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F0E2D8; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #7A4A2C">04</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45">Evaluation</span></li>
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F0E2D8; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #7A4A2C">05</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45">SHAP interpretation</span></li>
</ol>

<h2 style="margin: 64px 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Technologies used</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px">
<span style="background: #F3D9C8; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6A3E22">Python</span>
<span style="background: #F3D9C8; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6A3E22">Google Colab</span>
<span style="background: #F3D9C8; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6A3E22">XGBoost</span>
<span style="background: #F3D9C8; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6A3E22">SHAP</span>
<span style="background: #F3D9C8; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6A3E22">Pandas</span>
<span style="background: #F3D9C8; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6A3E22">NumPy</span>
<span style="background: #F3D9C8; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6A3E22">Matplotlib</span>
</div>

<div style="margin-top: 64px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F0E2D8; border-radius: 28px; padding: 32px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 24px; color: #7A4A2C">My part</p>
<p style="margin: 0">Solo project. Cleaning the data, building 18 features, training XGBoost (R² 0.76, RMSE 12,638), running SHAP and writing the research paper at the end: all done by me.</p>
</div>

<h2 style="margin: 64px 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Outcome</h2>
<p style="margin: 0">The project showed how machine learning can forecast retail demand while giving transparent insight into what drives each prediction, highlighting the value of explainable AI for business planning.</p>
</article>

<div class="col" style="padding-top: 96px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6B5F60; font-weight: 600">Next project</p>
<NextProject href="planet-zeta.html" name="Planet Zeta" bg="#D3E3F1" />
</div>
</div>
</ProjectLayout>
